WEBVTT

00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:06.647
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:09.660
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you buy that jacket in the end?

00:00:10.225 --> 00:00:13.815
<v><b>B:</b></v> I bought a jacket, but not the one I told you about.

00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:16.603
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:17.703 --> 00:00:19.463
<v><b>A:</b></v> There’s an Emily Blunt to see you.

00:00:19.878 --> 00:00:21.774
<v><b>B:</b></v> Not the Emily Blunt?

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:22.978
<v><b>A:</b></v> No, of course not!

00:00:23.248 --> 00:00:24.369
<v><b>B:</b></v> I didn’t think so.

00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:27.121
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:30.076
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you seen the um…

00:00:30.762 --> 00:00:31.684
<v><b>B:</b></v> The what?

00:00:32.149 --> 00:00:35.898
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh, you know, the thingy for the air-conditioning.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.672
<v><b>B:</b></v> The remote? It’s where you left it – in the kitchen.

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:42.593
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:43.555 --> 00:00:45.038
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you going to the party?

00:00:45.515 --> 00:00:46.543
<v><b>B:</b></v> Which party?

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:50.488
<v><b>A:</b></v> The party. The one everyone’s been talking about all week.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:55.393
<v><b>B:</b></v> If you mean the one on Saturday, I can’t go. I’m going to Paris for the weekend.